// The operator is a standalone Go module. This workspace file exists so that
// go commands run inside operator/ resolve against this module alone instead
// of the repository root's go.work, which would otherwise be found first and
// reject the directory as not belonging to any listed module.
//
// The root workspace deliberately does not include the operator: workspace
// mode unifies member requirements, and the operator's Kubernetes library
// versions would change what the root module resolves under `go build` while
// Bazel, reading only go.mod, would not follow.
go 1.26.0

use .
